    "description": {
      "value": "This filigree grants you, as the clan dagger owner, a +1 item bonus to Society checks and to Diplomacy checks to Request. Additionally, once per day, the filigree symbol can be activated to compel an enemy to act. You command a creature within 30 feet to Stride away from you, drop prone, or release one item it's holding. The creature can choose to perform that action as the first action on its next turn; if it doesn't, it takes 4d6 mental damage (DC 20 basic Will save). This item is implied to only be inscribable on a clan dagger. The bonuses increase to +2, the damage increases to 8d6, and the DC increases to 28."
    },
